O                0.2555957322        0.6170151386        0.3958220741
O                0.2204977574        0.9006200220        0.9412960089
O                0.7795022426        0.9006200220        0.5587039911
O                0.7759786088        0.0994041874        0.0590610585
O                0.2240213912        0.0994041874        0.4409389415

K_POINTS automatic
6 6 6 1 1 1

CELL_PARAMETERS angstrom
   4.5689412812   0.0000000000   0.0009568715
   0.0000000000   5.6122733897   0.0000000000
  -0.0525858794   0.0000000000   4.9368302630

HUBBARD {ortho-atomic}
